'''Dragon Breath''' is a [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] obtainable in the [[Second Sea]] and [[Third Sea]].

Dragon Breath allows the user to deal strong damage with fiery-ash based attacks.

==Obtainment==
Dragon Breath can be learned for {{Fragment|1,500}} from [[Sabi]].

The "{{Title|Dragonborn}}" [[Titles|title]] #0128 will be granted upon obtaining this specific fighting style.

==Mastery==
* '''300+ Mastery:''' Dragon Breath is one of the requirements to obtain [[Superhuman]] in [[Second Sea]] (or in [[Third Sea]]).
* '''400+ Mastery:''' Dragon Breath can be "upgraded" to [[Dragon Talon]] in [[Third Sea]].

