==Overview==
<tabber>
|-|Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Very cheap.
* Good range.
* Great hitboxes.
* All moves can hit multiple enemies at once.
* Decent damage.

|'''[Z] Dragon Rush'''
* Easy to catch people with.
* Briefly stuns targets.

|'''[X] Dragon Flames'''
* Decent knockback.
* Good combo starter.

|'''[C] Dragon Explosion'''
* Large hitbox.
* High damage.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Slow and close-ranged, giving it a disadvantage against ranged weapons.
* Deals heavy knockback to enemies, making it unsuitable for grinding.
* All moves lock the user in place
* Dashes on the fourth click (tap).

|'''[Z] Dragon Rush'''
*Slow speed.
* Only movement skill and is still not very good for traveling.
*Can be hard to hit against moving players.

|'''[X] Dragon Flames'''
* Short range.
* Most players will not stay within the flames created by this move, meaning it is almost impossible to execute full damage in PvP.

|'''[C] Dragon Explosion'''
* Slow startup which does not give I-Frames.
* Can be avoided easily by dashing or using Flash Step.
* Terrible for PvP.
}}
</tabber>

