==Trivia==
* Dragon Breath is the cheapest [[fighting style]] that costs {{Fragment|Fragments}}.
** Dragon Breath is also the only [[fighting style]] that does not require {{Money|Money}} to purchase.
* Dragon Breath's name used to be Dragon Claw.
* Usually, when equipping a [[fighting style]], the system message displays: 'Bought <Fighting Style> for {{Money|<Money>}} and {{Fragment|<Fragments>}}'. However, when equipping Dragon Breath, the message instead reads: 'Activated <Dragon Breath>.'

